msgctxt "ModManagerDialog|Info text"
msgid ""
"Mods are loaded from top to bottom and you can decide when a mod gets "
"loaded. It can be after the KeeperFX base game, after the campaign specific "
"changes, or after the map specific changes. Move them up or down to change "
"the order."
